{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24172","headline":"喜刘苏州恩赐金紫遥[想]贺宴以诗庆之 · 白居易","name":"喜刘苏州恩赐金紫遥[想]贺宴以诗庆之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内姑苏太守贤，恩加章绶岂徒然。\n贺宾喜色欺杯酒，醉妓欢声遏管弦。\n鱼佩葺鳞光照地，鹘衔瑞带势冲天。\n莫嫌鬓上些些白，金紫由来称长年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}